        "text": "Earning a Nobel Prize, specifically for protein structure prediction, demonstrates a clear lesson. It requires human curiosity and persistence to point a massive calculation engine toward a problem that yields tangible societal benefits. We see that same dynamic across other medical fields."
      },
      {
