        "text": "Let's take a moment here. I want you to pause the video right now. If someone walked up and asked you, what good does AI do for society, how would you respond? Think of your answer before hitting play. You likely realize that these everyday tools are not infallible guarantees. Instead, they act as highly practical enhancements. They build a direct bridge between complex math and immediate human needs. Whatever examples you thought of from our list,"
